        <item>
            <title>1.5.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 09:37:00 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://miq.marco-duering.net/</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>1.5.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>&lt;style&gt;
body { line-height: 1.45; margin: 10px 12px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1em; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
h1:first-child, h2:first-child, h3:first-child, p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
ul, ol { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.92em; background: rgba(128,128,128,.14);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 4px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reopening a file on an unresponsive network share no longer freezes the Quick Look window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reopening a large file on a network share no longer re-reads the whole file until you scroll or click in the preview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With per-volume windowing on, a timepoint viewed while a 4D &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;.nii.gz&lt;/code&gt; was still decompressing could stay stuck in black and white, with window/level not responding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Images with very small intensity values (e.g. ADC maps in SI units) now display with full contrast, and window/level dragging works on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compressed files larger than 4 GB no longer crash the preview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Files with zero or invalid voxel sizes now display instead of crashing the preview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed NRRD files that could be misread when their image data contained certain byte patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NIfTI-2 files are now labelled "NIfTI-2" in the metadata panel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases/download/v1.5.1/MIQ.app.zip" length="4264974" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Qw7o8Z//yQ9so6uTYl8jKubGOIrPPbe+zt77n8D/mT0t/+XF9Q5Jdr5UkGbFd88xkEOyVko5pY9DQLeJdzXSAw==" />
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 07:57:35 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://miq.marco-duering.net/</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>1.5.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description>&lt;style&gt;
body { line-height: 1.45; margin: 10px 12px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-size: 1em; font-weight: 600; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
h1:first-child, h2:first-child, h3:first-child, p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
p { margin: 0 0 8px; }
ul, ol { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.92em; background: rgba(128,128,128,.14);
  border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 4px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segmentation colouring for Finder thumbnails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for the MIF &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;Bit&lt;/code&gt; datatype (bit-packed masks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segmentation colouring &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;auto&lt;/code&gt; by default for preview and thumbnails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved handling of NaN and Inf voxels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir="auto"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed MIF anatomical orientation ignoring the &lt;code class="notranslate"&gt;transform&lt;/code&gt; header, which could mislabel left/right on obliquely-transformed volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minor GUI fixes in the main app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/marcoduering/MIQ/releases/download/v1.5.0/MIQ.app.zip" length="4255922" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="R6jYHrKVINWM0QH06/j71BOOyUSXj15mZ7sO7ylx7F7FF4A9WNsqWqlOVoOGOUZH0ELNC/k4J9h8X0xB72T+Cg==" />
